<title>UK: Rabobank sets $200 mln December 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets $200 mln December 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Nikko and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    31.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.9735  PAY DATE  L-28.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.786    SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1877    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
